      "writtenOn": "2024-12-06T14:54:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this should be fixed in Dawn if possible. Most of the `wgpu` structs have default initializers and many of the fields in `FragmentState` are initialized. It just is missing assigning `constants` to nullptr.",
